@startuml C4-Dynamic-OidcSignIn
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Dynamic — Sign in to Explore products with Explore IAM (OIDC)

autonumber
actor "End User" as user
participant "Product client\nAI Web · AI iOS · Chat iOS" as client <<ui>>
participant "Product API\nAI Backend :9000 · Chat API :9001" as api <<java>>
participant "Explore IAM\n:9100" as iam <<java>>

alt Web (AI Web, confidential client explore-ai)
  user -> client: Sign in with Explore IAM
  client -> api: GET /oauth2/authorization/explore-iam
  api --> user: Redirect to IAM /oauth2/authorize
else Native (AI iOS / Chat iOS, public client + PKCE)
  user -> client: Tap Sign in with IAM
  client -> client: PKCE verifier, challenge, state
  client -> iam: ASWebAuthenticationSession\nGET /oauth2/authorize (explore-ai-ios / explore-chat-ios)
end

iam --> user: /login: password, then OTT / passkey / TOTP
user -> iam: Credentials and second factor
iam --> user: Redirect to redirect_uri?code=…&state=…

alt Web
  user -> api: /login/oauth2/code/explore-iam?code=…
  api -> iam: POST /oauth2/token (client secret + code)
  iam --> api: Access + ID token
  api -> api: Link browser to account,\nmove guest data (GuestLinkedToAccountEvent)
  api --> client: Session cookie, redirect to SPA
else Native
  client -> iam: POST /oauth2/token (code + code_verifier)
  iam --> client: Access token (email / profile claims)
  client -> api: API call, Authorization: Bearer
  api -> iam: Fetch JWKS, check issuer
  api -> api: JWT → local account / owner
end
api --> client: 200 with account payload
client --> user: Signed-in home

note over client, iam
  Discovery: /.well-known/openid-configuration · custom-scheme redirects per RFC 8252
  Bearer requests skip CSRF · Commerce and Lowcode sign-in are planned
  Deactivated or deleted IAM users get no new tokens
end note

@enduml
